[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0010","text":"……哦，零食店啊\n有时间，要进去看看吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0020","text":"哇……\n是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0029","text":"老板"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0030","text":"──哎呀，欢迎光临"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0040","text":"打扰了\n真是让人怀念的店面啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0049","text":"老板"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0050","text":"哈哈，只是开得久了而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0055","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0060","text":"……那个，你感兴趣吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0070","text":"小时候……曾经给我买过……\n有……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0080","text":"哈哈，是吗\n那就买一个吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0085","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0090","text":"——我也买一个同样的吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_01_0100","text":"呵呵……你好……"}]
